---
import stories from '../data/stories.json';
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head><meta charset="utf-8" /><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" /><meta name="description" content="Persistent coding agents on your computer. Editable files, scheduled work and Git history. Open-source Gum Drops." /><title>Gum Drops · Agents with a place to call home</title></head>
<body>
  <header><a class="brand" href="/">Gum Drops<span class="brand-dot"></span></a><nav aria-label="Main"><a href="#how">How it works</a><a href="#stories">Stories</a><a href="https://github.com/AM1010101/gum-drops">GitHub ↗</a></nav></header>
  <main>
    <section class="hero"><div><p class="eyebrow">Open source. Runs on your computer.</p><h1>A little agent.<br />An ongoing job.</h1><p class="intro">Give a coding agent a role, a memory and a schedule. Gum Drops keeps it running, with conversations you can return to and files you can edit.</p><div class="actions"><a class="button" href="#install">Get started</a><a href="https://github.com/AM1010101/gum-drops">Read the source ↗</a></div><p class="small">macOS & Linux · Built on Pi · Bring your model provider</p></div><div class="hero-art" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 100 110"><defs>
<linearGradient id="gumdrop-body" x1=".2" y1="0" x2=".8" y2="1"><stop stop-color="white" stop-opacity=".52"/><stop offset=".3" stop-color="white" stop-opacity=".06"/><stop offset=".6" stop-color="white" stop-opacity="0"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#30142e" stop-opacity=".46"/></linearGradient>
<radialGradient id="gumdrop-glow" cx=".28" cy=".22" r=".75"><stop stop-color="white" stop-opacity=".38"/><stop offset=".65" stop-color="white" stop-opacity="0"/></radialGradient>
<radialGradient id="gumdrop-shadow"><stop stop-color="#302037" stop-opacity=".22"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#302037" stop-opacity="0"/></radialGradient>
<pattern id="gumdrop-sugar" width="9" height="11" patternUnits="userSpaceOnUse"><path d="M2 2l1.1 -.5 .6 1.3 -1 .6z" fill="white" opacity=".28"/><circle cx="7" cy="8" r=".65" fill="white" opacity=".38"/><circle cx="3" cy="9" r=".45" fill="#7e481b" opacity=".15"/></pattern>
<path id="gumdrop-shape" d="M20 85 C12 82 14 74 18 60 C24 37 31 17 50 17 C69 17 76 37 82 60 C86 74 88 82 80 85 C64 92 36 92 20 85Z"/>
</defs><ellipse cx="50" cy="98" rx="34" ry="6" fill="url(#gumdrop-shadow)"/>
<g class="character"><use href="#gumdrop-shape" fill="#f0a323"/><use href="#gumdrop-shape" fill="url(#gumdrop-body)"/><use href="#gumdrop-shape" fill="url(#gumdrop-glow)"/><use href="#gumdrop-shape" fill="none" stroke="#42233a" stroke-opacity=".14"/><use href="#gumdrop-shape" fill="url(#gumdrop-sugar)"/>
<path d="M29 46 C31 33 39 24 47 24 C54 24 50 30 43 33 C36 37 34 50 29 46Z" fill="white" opacity=".35"/><path d="M24 81 C40 86 61 86 76 81" fill="none" stroke="white" stroke-opacity=".23" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round"/>
<g transform="translate(0 8)"><ellipse cx="33" cy="60" rx="5" ry="2.3" fill="#f74776" opacity=".22"/><ellipse cx="67" cy="60" rx="5" ry="2.3" fill="#f74776" opacity=".22"/><g fill="#292033"><rect x="37" y="44.5" width="6.5" height="13" rx="3.25"/><rect x="56.5" y="44.5" width="6.5" height="13" rx="3.25"/></g><g fill="white" opacity=".8"><circle cx="39.3" cy="46.5" r="1"/><circle cx="58.8" cy="46.5" r="1"/></g></g></g></svg><span class="art-note">A character for every agent.</span></div></section>
    <section class="principles" id="how"><p class="eyebrow">Built for work that continues</p><h2>Your agents have a home.<br />You hold the keys.</h2><div class="columns"><article><span>01</span><h3>Files you can change</h3><p>An agent is a folder with an <code>AGENT.md</code> and a <code>memory.md</code>. Read its instructions, edit its memory and version them with Git.</p></article><article><span>02</span><h3>Work between visits</h3><p>The host runs in the background when you close the browser. Agents keep an ongoing conversation, split work into threads and run on a schedule.</p></article><article><span>03</span><h3>A record of each run</h3><p>Gum Drops snapshots runs on Git refs. Inspect and revert changes through the host and CLI. Questions that need you collect in the UI.</p></article></div></section>
    <section id="stories" class="stories"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">Help shape the next release</p><h2>What should we build next?</h2></div><p>Help choose what we build next. Open a story on GitHub, sign in and add a thumbs-up reaction.</p></div><div class="columns">{stories.map(story => <article class="story"><p class="eyebrow">{story.category}</p><h3>{story.title}</h3><p>{story.description}</p><a class="story-vote" href={story.url}>View issue & vote ↗</a></article>)}</div><p class="small">Votes are GitHub thumbs-up reactions. A GitHub account is required. You can also comment or contribute a fix.</p></section>
    <section id="install" class="install"><div><p class="eyebrow">Start with one agent</p><h2>Give it a job.<br />See what sticks.</h2><p>You need Node.js 22.19 or later and access to a model provider. Setup registers the background host and opens the UI.</p></div><div><pre><code>npm i -g gumdrops
gumdrops setup</code></pre><a href="https://github.com/AM1010101/gum-drops#install">Installation & documentation ↗</a></div></section>
  </main><footer><span>Gum Drops · Open source</span><a href="https://github.com/AM1010101/gum-drops">Code, issues & contributions ↗</a></footer>

<style is:global>
*{box-sizing:border-box}html{scroll-behavior:smooth}body{margin:0;background:#fbf7f0;color:#342c33;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',sans-serif;line-height:1.65}a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}a:hover{text-decoration:underline}header,main,footer{max-width:1200px;margin:auto}header{padding:32px 40px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center}.brand{font-family:'Trebuchet MS',sans-serif;font-size:23px;font-weight:800;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px}.brand-dot{width:10px;height:10px;border-radius:50%;background:#e6638a}nav{display:flex;gap:28px;font-size:14px}.hero{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.2fr 1fr;align-items:center;padding:65px 40px 95px;gap:40px}.eyebrow{text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:2px;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#947565}h1,h2,h3{font-family:'Trebuchet MS',sans-serif;line-height:1.1;letter-spacing:-2px}h1{font-size:clamp(44px,6vw,76px);margin:24px 0}h2{font-size:44px;margin:16px 0 40px}h3{font-size:22px;letter-spacing:-.6px;line-height:1.25}.intro{font-size:18px;max-width:510px;color:#74676b}.actions{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:24px;margin:30px 0}.button{background:#3c303b;color:#fff;padding:13px 23px;border-radius:8px;font-size:14px}.small{font-size:12px;color:#85787c}.hero-art{background:#f5e8dc;border-radius:48% 48% 38% 38%;padding:38px;position:relative;text-align:center}.hero-art svg{width:100%;max-width:350px}.art-note{display:block;font-size:12px;color:#8a6d74}.character{transform-origin:50px 87px;animation:breathe 6s ease-in-out infinite}@keyframes breathe{50%{transform:rotate(3deg) scale(1.01,.99)}}section{scroll-margin-top:24px}.principles{padding:70px 40px;border-top:1px solid #e5dcd4}.columns{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:28px}.columns p{font-size:15px;color:#786b70}.columns article>span{color:#bd9484;font-size:12px}.stories{padding:60px 40px;background:#f2ebe3;border-radius:20px}.section-heading{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:36px}.section-heading>p{max-width:310px;color:#786b70;font-size:14px}.story{display:flex;flex-direction:column;background:#fffaf4;padding:26px;border-radius:12px;border:1px solid #e9ddd3}.story>p:not(.eyebrow){flex:1}.story-vote{align-self:flex-start;background:transparent;border:1px solid #d6bdb3;border-radius:7px;padding:9px 14px;color:#573e49;cursor:pointer;font:inherit;font-size:13px}.count{margin-left:14px}.story-vote:hover{background:#f8e1e8}.story-vote:disabled{opacity:.7;cursor:default}.install{padding:95px 40px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:60px;align-items:center}.install p{max-width:430px;color:#786b70}pre{background:#352c35;color:#fae9d6;border-radius:12px;padding:26px;line-height:2;overflow:auto}code{font-family:monospace}footer{padding:28px 40px;border-top:1px solid #e5dcd4;font-size:12px;color:#85787c;display:flex;justify-content:space-between}a:focus-visible,button:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #be4270;outline-offset:5px}@media(max-width:760px){header{padding:24px}nav{gap:14px;font-size:12px}nav a:first-child{display:none}.hero{grid-template-columns:1fr;padding:36px 24px 60px}.hero-art{max-width:360px;width:100%;margin:auto}.columns{grid-template-columns:1fr}h2{font-size:34px}.principles,.stories{padding:40px 24px}.stories{border-radius:0}.section-heading{display:block}.install{grid-template-columns:1fr;padding:60px 24px;gap:10px}footer{padding:24px;gap:24px}}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){html{scroll-behavior:auto}.character{animation:none}}
</style>
</body></html>
